  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CleanTech Center i Gaborone - Fas 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CleanTech Centre in Gaborone - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att etablera ett CleanTech center inom ramen f&#xf6;r    Botswana Innovation Hubs verksamhet. Under Sidas p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende st&#xf6;d, ett   &#xe5;r, ska projektet ha kopplat till sig relevanta lokala akt&#xf6;rer och    ett program f&#xf6;r utveckling inom CleanTech. P&#xe5; centret ska f&#xf6;retag och institutioner f&#xe5; st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r sina tekniska och aff&#xe4;rsm&#xe4;ssiga id&#xe9;er inom  CleanTech f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar ekonomisk utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to establish a CleanTech Centre of Expertise within Botswana Innovation Hub, and giving way for further involvement of    other relevant local actors. The project is meant to offer a centre   with science and development studies as well as infrastructure for    companies to develop a clean technology for products and services for sustainable economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
